OL,3,GNEWSACrime drama is not portrayal of
OL,4,Acity I want to see, says mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mayor has said he would like TV
OL,7,Fdramas set in his home city to focus on
OL,8,Fthe "warmth" of the people, rather than
OL,9,F"drugs, organised crime and criminal
OL,10,Factivity".
OL,12,FSteve Rotheram, the metro mayor of the
OL,13,FLiverpool city region, said he had just
OL,14,Ffinished watching the second series of
OL,15,FBBC One drama This City is Ours, which
OL,16,Ffollows the fortunes of the fictional
OL,17,FPhelan crime family, and is filmed
OL,18,Facross the area and in Spain.
OL,20,FRotheram said the drama was "brilliant"
OL,21,Fand praised its "cinematic, film-like"
OL,22,Fquality and "top-notch" acting.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
